{"id":"dce23e9e6907b821","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-scp.md","title":"Strong Congruence Property","display":"df-scp — Strong Congruence Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-scp","aliases":["93-df-scp"],"display":"df-scp — Strong Congruence Property","depends_on":["[[93-df-logic]]","[[93-df-theory]]","[[93-df-logic-algebra]]","[[93-df-valuation]]","[[93-df-language]]","[[93-df-congruence]]","[[93-df-consequence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-scp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-scp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-scp — Strong Congruence Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bd7e4207897c8db3\" href=\"?note=bd7e4207897c8db3\" title=\"93-df-logic\">93-df-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cf7108c33537548a\" href=\"?note=cf7108c33537548a\" title=\"93-df-theory\">93-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"00b872b34c5e977d\" href=\"?note=00b872b34c5e977d\" title=\"93-df-logic-algebra\">93-df-logic-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8181bcdfbad8d73a\" href=\"?note=8181bcdfbad8d73a\" title=\"93-df-valuation\">93-df-valuation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a33dcee0f62c9026\" href=\"?note=a33dcee0f62c9026\" title=\"93-df-language\">93-df-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"afd7605d365be7b6\" href=\"?note=afd7605d365be7b6\" title=\"93-df-consequence\">93-df-consequence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L\">\\(\\mathsf L\\)</span> is a logic-presentation candidate; its language, generated formula universe, and consequence relation are unpacked inside <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SCP}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{SCP}_{93}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}\\)</span> is the sourced type-indexed finitary structural-logic predicate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}\\)</span> is the language predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a33dcee0f62c9026\" href=\"?note=a33dcee0f62c9026\" title=\"93-df-language\">93-df-language</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma}}\">\\(\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma}}\\)</span> is the formula algebra constructed from the exact language type in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8181bcdfbad8d73a\" href=\"?note=8181bcdfbad8d73a\" title=\"93-df-valuation\">93-df-valuation</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogicAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{LogicAlg}_{93}\\)</span> is the typed logic-algebra predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"00b872b34c5e977d\" href=\"?note=00b872b34c5e977d\" title=\"93-df-logic-algebra\">93-df-logic-algebra</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}_{93}^{F,\\vdash}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}_{93}^{F,\\vdash}\\)</span>, the local Frege relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda_{93}(T;F,\\vdash)\">\\(\\Lambda_{93}(T;F,\\vdash)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SCP}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{SCP}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}scp}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cn}_{93}^{F,\\vdash}(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in F:\\langle\\Gamma,\\varphi\\rangle\\in\\vdash\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}scp}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cn}_{93}^{F,\\vdash}(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in F:\\langle\\Gamma,\\varphi\\rangle\\in\\vdash\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}scp}\\vdash\n\\Lambda_{93}(T;F,\\vdash)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\langle\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle\\in F^2:\n\\mathrm{Cn}_{93}^{F,\\vdash}(T\\cup\\{\\varphi\\})\n=\\mathrm{Cn}_{93}^{F,\\vdash}(T\\cup\\{\\psi\\})\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}scp}\\vdash\n\\Lambda_{93}(T;F,\\vdash)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\langle\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle\\in F^2:\n\\mathrm{Cn}_{93}^{F,\\vdash}(T\\cup\\{\\varphi\\})\n=\\mathrm{Cn}_{93}^{F,\\vdash}(T\\cup\\{\\psi\\})\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}scp}\\vdash\\mathrm{SCP}_{93}(\\mathsf L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma},F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathsf L=\\langle\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma},F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma})\n\\land F=T_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma})}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma})}(F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L})\n\\land\\mathrm{LogicAlg}_{93}(\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma}},\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Theory}_{93}(T;\\mathrm{Cn}_{93}^{F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}})\n\\to\\Lambda_{93}(T;F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L})\n\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma}})\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}scp}\\vdash\\mathrm{SCP}_{93}(\\mathsf L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma},F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathsf L=\\langle\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma},F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Lang}_{93}(\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma})\n\\land F=T_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma})}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau_{93}(\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma})}(F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L})\n\\land\\mathrm{LogicAlg}_{93}(\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma}},\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Theory}_{93}(T;\\mathrm{Cn}_{93}^{F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L}})\n\\to\\Lambda_{93}(T;F,\\vdash_{\\mathsf L})\n\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathfrak{Fm}_{\\mathcal L_{\\Sigma}})\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>SCP is the strong congruence property of a logic: every local Frege equivalence must be a congruence of the formula algebra. The language type indexes both structurality and the formula-algebra constructor, while the consequence operator and Frege relation expose <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> as explicit parameters.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bd7e4207897c8db3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"cf7108c33537548a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-lo